title: $:/themes/BurningTreeC/vanilla-paper/trackers/menubar
tags: $:/tags/DimensionTracker
selector: nav.tc-menubar
info-tiddler: $:/info/browser/menubar

Measures the menubar plugin's fixed bar, if one is present, so the theme can
offset the story river, the sidebar and the sticky tiddler titles by its real
height rather than by a guess.

Consumed in `$:/themes/BurningTreeC/vanilla-paper/layout` as `--btc-menubar-h`.
